$ grpcurl  list
grpc.health.v1.Health
test.Greeter
$ grpcurl  describe test.Greeter.Count
test.Greeter.Count is a method:
rpc Count ( .test.CountRequest ) returns ( stream .test.CountResponse );
$ grpcurl -d {"name": "Ada"} test.Greeter/SayHello
{
  "message": "hello, Ada"
}
$ grpcurl -d {"arg1": 3} test.Greeter/Count
{
  "value": "1"
}
{
  "value": "2"
}
{
  "value": "3"
}
$ grpcurl -d {"arg1": 2} test.Greeter/Countdown
{
  "value": "2"
}
{
  "value": "1"
}
